number of pixels), 24 lines can always be supported and around 48 lines<br>
can be supported with using screens of 1280 by 1024 pixels.&nbsp; If<br>
60 lines are to be supported, a larger pixel count is required.&nbsp; A
screen<br>
of 1800 by 1440 pixels has been found to easily support 60 lines under<br>
the Win32 version of Erstaz-11.<br>
