&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; few differences as possible from the versions of KED / KED<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; which support only 24 vertical lines<br>
